><strong>Optimaal om vet te verliezen</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:white\">Training op maximale hartslag om zo een optimale verbranding tot stand te brengen.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:white\"><strong>After Burn Effect</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:white\">De verbranding kan door middel van het After Burn Effect (of EPOC) tot wel 72 uur na de training doorwerken.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span class=\"inline-block align-top mb-4 mr-2\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cta/60 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none cursor-pointer select-none whitespace-nowrap font-sl-poppins border border-cta bg-transparent text-cta hover:bg-cta hover:text-ink h-11 px-5 text-base\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Boek proefles</span></a></span></p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"flex items-center w-full relative h-auto flex-row lg:py-12 bg-background text-sand sm:min-h-180 xxl:min-h-[1080px]\"><div class=\"container m-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 py-15 lg:py-0 h-full content-start\"><div class=\"flex h-full justify-between w-full self-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:gap-0 w-full relative self-baseline\"><picture class=\"h-[400px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[200px] w-full relative mb-4\"><img alt=\"strenght training\" fetchPriority=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"570\" height=\"350\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-cover h-full w-full lg:object-center object-center\" style=\"color:transparent;background-size:cover;background-position:50% 50%;background-repeat:no-repeat;backgr